{
  "title": "Salawat upon Imam al-Sadiq (a.s.)",
  "data": "اَللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَىٰ جَعْفَرِ بْنِ مُحَمَّدٍ الصَّادِقِ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA JA'FARIBNI MUHAMMADINIS SAADIQ\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon Ja'far the son of Muhammad the veracious,\nخَازِنِ الْعِلْمِ\nKHAAZINIL I'LM\nthe treasure of knowledge,\nالدَّاعِي اِلَيْكَ بِالْحَقِّ\nAD-DAA'EE ILAYKA BIL HAQQ\nthe caller to You with the truth,\nالنُّورِ الْمُبِينِ\nAN-NOORIL MUBEEN\nand the manifest light.\nاَللَّهُمَّ وَكَمَا جَعَلْتَهٗ مَعْدِنَ كَلَامِكَ وَوَحْيِكَ\nALLAAHUMMA WA KAMAA JA'ALTAHOO MA'DINA KALAAMIKA WA WAHYIK\nO Allah, as You have made him the core of Your words and revelations,\nوَخَازِنَ عِلْمِكَ\nWA KHAAZINA I'LMIK\nthe treasure of Your knowledge,\nوَلِسَانَ تَوْحِيدِكَ\nWA LISAANA TAWHEEDIK\nthe spokesman of the profession of Your Oneness,\nوَوَلِيَّ اَمْرِكَ\nWA WALIYYA AMRIK\nthe authorized to undertake Your mission,\nوَمُسْتَحْفَظَ دِينِكَ\nWA MUSTAHFAZA DEENIK\nand the keeper of Your religion,\nفَصَلِّ عَلَيْهِ\nFASALLI A'LAYH\nso also (please) send blessings upon him\nاَفْضَلَ مَا صَلَّيْتَ عَلَىٰ اَحَدٍ\nAFDALA MAA SALLAYTA A'LAA AHAD\nwith the most excellent blessings that You have ever sent upon any\nمِنْ اَصْفِيَائِكَ وَحُجَجِكَ\nMIN ASFIYAA'IKA WA HUJAJIK\nof Your elite people and arguments.\nاِنَّكَ حَمِيدٌ مَجِيدٌ\nINNAKA HAMEEDUM MAJEED\nVerily, You are full of praise, full of glory.",
  "merits": "Among the recommended rites of Fridays, Shaykh al-Tusi, in Misbah al-Mutahajjid, records an invocation of blessings upon the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.), Lady Fatimah (s.a.) and each of the Imams (a.s.) in turn, reported from Imam al-Hasan al-'Askari (a.s.). This is its part upon Imam al-Sadiq (a.s.)."
}
